The cathedral has been a base of the [[Huntik Foundation]] operations for decades. One of the gargoyles faces the [[abandoned church in Paris]] which hides the entrance to the [[Paris Catacombs]]. {{source|Crawling the Catacombs}}

The [[Ring of Arc]] was kept in the Cathedral of Notre Dame, watched over by [[Clements]]. {{source|Divide and Conquer}}

When the Titan of Fate, [[Arc]] became active, Clements went missing while the possessed [[Freelancer]], [[Hoplite]] and [[Ironsquire]] atacked tourists outside the Cathedral. The Huntik team dealt with the [[Titans]] and adventured into the Catacombs. After [[Arc]] was defeated, Clements returned to the base whilst [[Zhalia]] helped [[Metz]] with a cover story for the Titan altercation. {{source|The Legendary Titan of Fate}}

